dh-weather-sandstorm-start = A sandstorm is rising: it is harder to move out in the open.
dh-weather-sandstorm-heavy-start = A heavy sandstorm is coming! Out in the open the sand cuts the skin — get under a roof or into a vehicle.
dh-weather-rain-start = It starts to rain.
dh-weather-downpour-start = A downpour with thunder: it is harder to move out in the open.
